Set in 1979, the film follows a cast and crew who gather to make a pornographic film on an elderly
couple's rural Texas property but find themselves threatened by the homicidal couple.

14
01:01:50,000 --> 01:01:56,000
A24 announced X in November 2020.

15
01:06:15,000 --> 01:06:21,000
Principal photography occurred in February–March
2021, primarily in Fordell, New Zealand.

16
01:10:40,000 --> 01:10:46,000
Goth underwent extensive prosthetic makeup for Pearl, and special
effects were employed to depict violent scenes in the film.

17
01:15:05,000 --> 01:15:11,000
Characterized as a contemporary take on psycho-biddy, X draws inspiration from horror, exploitation, and
pornographic films, and emphasizes the interplay between beauty, aging, and self-worth.

18
01:19:30,000 --> 01:19:36,000
The score was composed by Tyler Bates and Chelsea Wolfe.

19
01:23:55,000 --> 01:24:01,000
X had its world premiere at South by Southwest on March 13, 2022, and was
theatrically released in the United States five days later by A24.

20
01:28:20,000 --> 01:28:26,000
It received generally positive reviews from critics.

21
